# Zahur, Glory's Past: "Max speed - Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token."
# (CR 702.178a, 700.4, 111.7, 603.10a). Lightning Bolt to Bot2's face on turns 3, 5 and 7 brings the speed to 4 (CR 702.179d). On turn 7
# Bot2's Memnite dies to a Bolt and gives Bot1 nothing; then Bot1 sacrifices its own Memnite to Zahur's ability (surveil 1, the top
# Plains is kept) and gets exactly one tapped 2/2 Zombie. The ability is spent for the turn even with the Zombie to sacrifice. On
# turn 9 sacrificing that Zombie token makes no further Zombie (a token is not a nontoken creature).

